==Description==
The '''Follower Nametag''' was a nametag given to anyone who redeemed the now-expired code NAMETAGSRCOOL, which had a limited stock of 40,000.

This nametag is themed around the social media platform X and its former brand colors. The '''Follower Nametag''' is colored with a white-to-teal vertical gradient and a black outline. Red heart and green repost effects, the ones used by X, randomly generate, float up, and disappear shortly after generation.

